      "cooked": "<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/we-were-at-gen-con-so-no-episode-sode\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/we-were-at-gen-con-so-no-episode-sode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img width=\"250\" height=\"250\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/a/a207b25d5dc8a6620aab8ce801ba438ae9da3f25.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" data-dominant-color=\"837B72\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/we-were-at-gen-con-so-no-episode-sode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: \"We Were at Gen Con so No Episode\"-Sode</a></h3>\n\n  <p>It was really great getting to see so many of you at Gen Con this year. You're the best, and we're incredibly honored to have you all as listeners, as fans, and as an important part of the extended Sentinels family. We had a very truthy Gen Con 2026...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
