      "cooked": "<p>I will ask here instead of the full Gen Con episode-<br>\nAdam might have mentioned a personal project of his. anyone know if there was one?</p>\n<p>On his art page I saw concept art for a theoretical post digital convergence, post reconstruction after an apocalypse RPG setting. But gaming artists would often draw pregen character class art for unreal games.</p>",
